---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms &amp; Conditions – GiftIdeasFor"
  description="Terms and Conditions for GiftIdeasFor. Review the rules, guidelines, and legal terms governing the use of our gift discovery platform."
  canonical="https://giftideasforx.com/terms"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Terms and Conditions",
      "description": "Terms and Conditions for GiftIdeasFor gift discovery platform.",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "name": "GiftIdeasFor",
        "url": "https://giftideasforx.com/"
      }
    }
  </script>

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-black/10 pb-8">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A]">
        Terms &amp; Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#1A1A1A]/50">Last updated: January 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-8 text-[#1A1A1A]/80">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using GiftIdeasFor ("the Platform"), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must not use our services. We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time, and continued use of the Platform constitutes acceptance of any changes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">2. Description of Service</h2>
      <p>
        GiftIdeasFor is a gift discovery platform that provides personalized gift recommendations through an interactive quiz and curated collections. Our recommendations are generated by a proprietary scoring engine based on user-provided information and are intended as suggestions only. We do not sell physical products directly; we facilitate discovery and may provide affiliate links to third-party merchants.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
      <p>As a user of the Platform, you agree to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Provide accurate and truthful information when using the Gift Finder Quiz.</li>
        <li>Use the Platform only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms.</li>
        <li>Not attempt to manipulate, disrupt, or exploit the Platform's functionality.</li>
        <li>Not reproduce, distribute, or commercially exploit any content from the Platform without our written consent.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on the Platform, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, images, quiz algorithms, and software, is the property of GiftIdeasFor or its content suppliers and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not use, reproduce, modify, or distribute our content without prior written permission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">5. Third-Party Links and Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Our Platform may contain links to third-party websites and affiliate product links. GiftIdeasFor may earn a small commission on qualifying purchases made through these links at no additional cost to you. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of third-party sites. We only recommend products we genuinely believe in, and our editorial integrity is never compromised by affiliate relationships.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The Platform and its services are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We make no warranties, expressed or implied, regarding the accuracy, reliability, or completeness of our recommendations. GiftIdeasFor does not guarantee that the recipient of your gift will be satisfied with the chosen product. All gift recommendations are suggestions based on algorithmic analysis of the information you provide.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        GiftIdeasFor, its officers, directors, employees, and affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Platform. This includes, but is not limited to, damages for loss of profits, goodwill, or data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">8. User-Generated Content</h2>
      <p>
        If you submit stories, reviews, or other content to our Platform (such as through our "Share Your Story" feature), you grant GiftIdeasFor a non-exclusive, royalty-free, perpetual license to use, reproduce, modify, and display such content in connection with our services. You represent that your content is original and does not violate any third-party rights.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">9. Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to the Platform at our sole discretion, without prior notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users, third parties, or our business interests.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">10. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of California, United States, without regard to its conflict of law principles. Any disputes arising from these Terms shall be resolved in the courts of San Francisco County, California.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-light italic text-[#1A1A1A] mt-10 mb-4">11. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about these Terms, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p class="bg-[#FAF9F6] border border-black/10 p-4">
        <strong>Email:</strong> legal@giftideasforx.com<br />
        <strong>Address:</strong> GiftIdeasFor, Faridabad, Haryana, India
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>

